SUMMARY:Deadline 23:59 CET: PhD Position in Space Law and Artificial Intell
 igence\, EO-TRUST project (Vrije Universiteit Amsterdam)
DESCRIPTION:Closes 27 Nov 2026 at 23:59 CET.\n\nA funded law PhD on the leg
 al and ethical governance of AI-enabled Earth observation under the EU AI 
 Act\, the proposed EU Space Act and space\, security and military law\, wi
 thin the EO-TRUST project. Requires an LL.M. or equivalent law master's\, 
 ideally in technology or AI law\, space law\, EU law or public internation
 al law. Apply by 27 November 2026\, 23:59.\n\nOrganisation: Vrije Universi
 teit Amsterdam\, Faculty of Law\nLocation: Amsterdam\, Netherlands\nAward:
  EUR 3\,204 to 4\,051 gross per month (at least 0.8 FTE). No application f
 ee.\nDuration: 1 year\, extendable to 4 years\; starts 1 February 2027\n\n
 More: https://workingat.vu.nl/vacancies/phd-position-in-space-law-and-arti
 ficial-intelligence-amsterdam-1346045?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdes
 k&utm_medium=referral
