  Instituut residency in Milan)
DESCRIPTION:Closes 15 Nov 2026 at 23:59 CET.\n\nTwo NL-based residents with
  a critical social\, spatial or environmental practice rethink what design
  weeks could be\, working with Milan communities through cheFare. Duos may
  apply\, but only one person travels and the budget stays the same. Submit
  a PDF via the online form by 15 November 2026\, 23:59 CET.\n\nOrganisatio
 n: Nieuwe Instituut with cheFare and the Dutch Embassy and Consulate-Gener
 al in Italy (curated by Collective Works)\nLocation: Milan\, Italy. For de
 signers\, architects and creatives based in the Netherlands.\nAward: EUR 1
 0\,000 fixed fee plus EUR 4\,000 production budget per designer (excl. VAT
 )\, plus train travel\, accommodation\, studio and up to EUR 40/day per di
 em. No application fee.\nDuration: About 3 weeks in April 2027 (Milan Desi
 gn Week) and about 5 weeks in September/October 2027\, with a presentation
  at Milan Design Week 2028\n\nMore: https://www.nieuweinstituut.nl/en/arti
 cles/open-call-civicity-2027?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_med
 ium=referral
