SUMMARY:Deadline 15:00 CET: AFK Amsterdam Fund for the Arts: Project Subsid
 ies 2026-2028
DESCRIPTION:Closes 02 Dec 2026 at 15:00 CET.\n\nThe general Amsterdam proje
 ct grant for individuals\, collectives and organisations living or working
  in Amsterdam or nearby municipalities\, across disciplines including digi
 tal and media work. Categories 1 and 2 use a monthly lottery (next draw 2 
 December 2026\, 15:00\; only drawn applicants then submit a full applicati
 on)\; categories 3 and 4 are rolling within half-year budget ceilings.\n\n
 Organisation: Amsterdams Fonds voor de Kunst (AFK)\nLocation: Amsterdam an
 d nearby municipalities (Zaanstad\, Amstelveen\, Haarlemmermeer\, Diemen a
 nd others)\nAward: Category 1: EUR 1\,500 to 2\,500\; category 2: EUR 2\,5
 00 to 7\,500\; category 3: EUR 7\,500 to 17\,500 (includes artistic develo
