 , plus a private studio and a work budget. FEES: non-refundable applicatio
 n fee of EUR 60 (waived for artists living in OECD DAC-list countries) and
  an annual participation fee of EUR 1\,875 for selected residents.\nDurati
 on: 12 months\, January to December 2028\, with the possibility of a secon
 d year\; about 23 artists per year.\n\nMore: https://rijksakademie.nl/en/r
 esidency-apply/apply?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=refe
 rral
